1
00:01:03,408 --> 00:01:06,528
so he decided to search for a new home.

2
00:01:07,488 --> 00:01:13,056
He met many other birds, but all of them thought that he was ugly too.

3
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:16,000
They did not want him to live with them.

4
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:20,448
One day, the duckling met a cat and a hen.

5
00:01:21,344 --> 00:01:25,088
“May I stay with you?” he asked hopefully.

6
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,728
But the two animals said no.

7
00:01:27,984 --> 00:01:29,472
They did not like him

8
00:01:29,648 --> 00:01:32,528
because he could not purr or lay eggs!

9
00:01:33,408 --> 00:01:37,472
Some days later, the ugly duckling came to a lake.

10
00:01:37,888 --> 00:01:44,224
There, he saw three beautiful swans with long necks and white feathers.

11
00:01:44,976 --> 00:01:48,512
“I wish I looked like you!” he cried.

12
00:01:49,072 --> 00:01:52,288
“My friend, you do look like us!

13
00:01:52,432 --> 00:01:56,016
Look in the water!” one of the swans said.

14
00:01:56,544 --> 00:01:58,240
The duckling looked down,

15
00:01:58,416 --> 00:01:59,984
and to his surprise,

16
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:04,288
he saw that he was a beautiful white swan too!

